A new version of Rss is out. It adds RSS extensions W3C Basic Geo and Podlove Simple Chapters.

lastBuildDate and pubDate now also accept DateTimeImmutable (instead of just DateTime).

GenericElement is now deprecated, use new XmlElement instead. It supports attributes and works better with namespaces (it uses namespace URI).

For complete list of changes since previous version, see CHANGELOG.md.
